==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|steinn|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*stainaz}}, ultimately from the {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} root {{term/t|ine-pro|*stāi-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/steitn/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eitn|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|steins|steinar}}

# [[stone]], [[rock]]
# [[stone]], [[pit]], [[pip]] (the seed of certain [[fruit]])
# {{context|medicine|lang=is}} a [[calculus]], a [[stone]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-m-s1|st|ei|n|n|i=i}}

